                  <Label style="-fx-font-weight: bold; -fx-text-fill: #cd1212;" text="1. Adding Force Vector" textFill="#cd1212">
                     <font>
                        <Font name="System Bold" size="12.0" />
                     </font>
                  </Label>
                  <Label prefWidth="387.0" text="To add a force vector, you need to input the x and why coordinate of &#10;the vector of the corresponding boxes. &#10;(The box on the left is for x coordinate and the box on the right is for&#10; the y coordinate)&#10;&#10;Once having written down your vectors components into the textfields,&#10;you may press the add button. Once pressed, your vector should apear &#10;in the section number 2. &#10;&#10;If you want to remove a force vector, you must select the undesirable &#10;vector in section 2 by clicking it with your cursor. &#10;You may then press the remove button and it should remove it &#10;&#10;The resset button will remove all force vectors and will wipe the all the &#10;texfields clean. " />
                  <Label style="-fx-text-fill: #ebe715;" text="2. List of Currently Added Force Vectors">
                     <font>
                        <Font name="System Bold" size="12.0" />
                     </font>
                  </Label>
                  <Label text="All your force vectors will apear here as a list. You may select specific &#10;vectors and remove them as you see fit via the remove button from the &#10;section number 1. &#10;&#10;Force vectors will apear under this format:&#10;&lt;&quot;x coordinate&quot;, &quot;y coordinate&quot;&gt;&#10;" />
                  <Label style="-fx-text-fill: #1bbc81;" text="3. Adding Mass and Acceleration Toggle">
                     <font>
                        <Font name="System Bold" size="12.0" />
                     </font>
                  </Label>
                  <Label text="Here you can add the mass, it should autimatically update the graph that&#10;apears in section 4 if there are force vectors listed in section 2. &#10;You may check &quot;Show Net Acceleration&quot; to display an additional &#10;vector in section 4 that shows the net Acceleration&#10;" />
                  <Label style="-fx-text-fill: #cd6520;" text="4. The Graph Display">
